OL,3,GNEWSATyne Bridge to close during
OL,4,AOctober half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FSignificant travel disruption is
OL,7,Fexpected during the October half-term
OL,8,Fwhen the Tyne Bridge closes for 10
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council has urged people
OL,12,Fto plan their journeys ahead of the
OL,13,Ffull closure, which will allow
OL,14,Fspecialist teams to build scaffolding
OL,15,Fahead of work on the bridge's main
OL,16,Fsteel arch, scheduled to begin in early
OL,17,F2027.
OL,19,FUnlike previous closures, access will
OL,20,Fnot be maintained for pedestrians and
OL,21,Fcyclists for safety reasons.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
