OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATyne Bridge to close during
OL,4,AOctober half-term
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Colin Ferguson said: "We
OL,7,Ffully recognise that this will be
OL,8,Fdisruptive, which is why we have
OL,9,Fcarefully planned this with our
OL,10,Fcontractor to ensure this complex stage
OL,11,Fis programmed during the half-term
OL,12,Fbreak, with fewer cars on the road."
